/*
A wildcard NODATA read end to end (issue #334).

The wildcard's record stands in for the name, so it has to pass what a record
on the name would. `wntest.`'s wildcard carries NS without SOA: a wildcard
delegation, which answers with a referral, so a NODATA built from its NSEC is
not a proof. `wotest.` is an NSEC3 zone with opt-out on every span, and RFC
5155 section 9.2 forbids AD over a next closer cover that is one.

Generated - `testdata/gen/sign_fixtures.py`, scenario `wildcard_nodata`.
*/

@(private = "file")
WN_ANCHOR :: ". IN DS 50229 15 2 AF865B7B626B0B6F0E847FFFC75C8ECB4275D86E3E3EE9C7552BD6DC2089ED99"

